{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1734490325_4995913_a96891b67e79bc2dc839369ef7f8d421.jpg",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"14981c01-6b10-4e9d-98d7-4aaadad9e180\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>Yotruth is a leading brand specializing in premium truck interior protection products. Our main offerings include custom-fit seat covers, floor mats, and liners designed to provide optimal protection and tailored solutions for your vehicle.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>Yotruth's product range features seat covers and floor mats crafted to fit a variety of vehicle models with precision. Each product is designed to enhance durability, protect interiors, and maintain an aesthetic appeal.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>Yotruth stands out by offering custom-designed truck seat covers and floor mats that ensure a perfect fit for specific vehicle models. This precision fit guarantees exceptional interior protection and comfort.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>Yotruth accepts multiple payment methods, including credit cards, PayPal, and other secure online payment options. Detailed payment information is available on the checkout page of our website.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>In addition to seat covers and floor mats, Yotruth provides other automotive accessories such as mud flaps, air compressors, sleeping bags, and pet seat covers, catering to a variety of customer needs. We are committed to delivering top-notch products and excellent customer service, ensuring every customer finds the perfect interior protection solution for their vehicle.</p>",
